{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gold for Retirement</strong> - is a hardcore platformer that will challenge you and push your skills to the limit! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an exciting adventure where every gold coin brings you one step closer to a carefree retirement. Explore dozens of levels filled with tough challenges and dangerous traps.Enjoy stylish pixel art that immerses you in the atmosphere of classic platformers, and lose yourself in the game\u2019s world thanks to its incredible soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>But the main highlight</strong>\u00a0- is the unique flying mechanic! Your knight is equipped with a special device built into their helmet, allowing them to soar, glide, and overcome even the most difficult obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648250/extras/2__1_.gif?t=1744223009\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The demo version features 7 levels and 4 soundtracks.</strong> Explore diverse levels and enjoy the atmospheric music that creates a unique audio experience for your gameplay.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648250?t=1744223009","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648250/54f60bbf806689bf18c0677170133700b0ebb4eb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744223009","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648250/6801dcd4c4f853fa95af25ccae8c191534f898dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744223009","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648250/6801dcd4c4f853fa95af25ccae8c191534f898dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744223009","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null